# TV360 Lucky Draw — Design System

**Figma source:** [HOME screen](https://www.figma.com/design/gHuCWVdmvHEAG3fQDCWaol/Untitled?node-id=2-755&m=dev)

Stack: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4. Use a full-page vertical layout with a stadium background image. Do not use absolute pixel positioning from Figma — use flex/grid and responsive spacing.

## Page Structure (4 Divisions)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. HEADER                               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 2. TAGLINE (centered)                   │
├──────────────────┬──────────────────────┤
│ 3a. Rewards List │ 3b. Winner Panel     │
├──────────────────┴──────────────────────┤
│ 4. FOOTER                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Division 1 — Header
- Top-left: **TV360 Myanmar logo** then **FIFA World Cup logo** side by side
- Fixed height, horizontal padding ~90px from left edge
- No centered content in this row

### Division 2 — Tagline
- Horizontally centered
- Main title: **"LUCKY 360 CUP"** — large italic display text with white-to-grey gradient and gold/red glow
- Subtitle: campaign dates (e.g. `12 June 2026 to 20 July 2026`) in white
- Accent: **"LuckyDraw"** in gold-to-red gradient script style, right of dates

### Division 3 — Main Content (two columns)

**Left column — Rewards list**
- Dark red card (`#7a0513`) with `border-[#ff2e33]`, `rounded-xl`, drop shadow
- Card header bar (`#61030e`): **"LUCKY 360 CUP PROMOTION CAMPAIGN REWARDS"**
- Hint text: *"Click the item you want to draw"* in `#c7bebe`
- Scrollable list of reward items; each item shows: thumbnail, prize name, quantity (`0/1`)
- Selected item: `border-2 border-[#ffc300]` gold highlight; unselected: white bg, `border-[#b2020d]`

**Right column — Winner panel**
- Prize name bar: dark red bg (`#670105`), gold gradient text (`#ff8a04` → `#fc0`)
- Prize image: centered, prominent product visual on glowing pedestal
- Label: **"WINNER'S PHONE NUMBER"** — small caps, white-to-grey gradient
- Phone display: large bold placeholder (`09xxxxxxxxx`) in dark gradient text inside a styled input/display box
- **SELECT WINNER** button: glossy red pill with gold trim, white gradient text
- **Upload File** button: grey pill (`#6e6e6e`), white underlined text, upload icon — accepts Excel

### Division 4 — Footer
- Full-width red bar at bottom
- Left: **WORLD CUP PACKAGES** + package icons
- Center: *"Catch Every Match LIVE from Start to Finish on TV360"*
- Right: QR code + website link (`tv360.mytel.com.mm/app`)

## Design Tokens

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Primary red | `#7a0513`, `#670105`, `#61030e`, `#b2020d` |
| Accent red | `#ff2e33`, `#ff2504` |
| Gold | `#ffc300`, `#fc0`, `#ff8a04` |
| Text primary | `white` |
| Text muted | `#c7bebe`, `#8d8c8c` |
| Text dark | `#232323` |
| Upload btn | `#6e6e6e` |

**Fonts:** `Povlar Slant` for display titles and buttons; `Supreme` (Regular/Medium/Bold/Extrabold) for UI labels and reward items. Load via project assets or `@font-face`.

## Component Guidelines

- Extract sections as components: `Header`, `Tagline`, `RewardsList`, `WinnerPanel`, `Footer`
- Reward selection is interactive — clicking a list item updates the right panel (prize name + image)
- Use semantic HTML (`header`, `main`, `footer`, `button`) and accessible labels on all buttons
- Background image covers full viewport; content sits above it with appropriate z-index

```jsx
// ✅ GOOD — semantic 4-division layout
<div className="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-cover bg-center">
  <header className="flex items-center gap-4 px-[90px] py-6">...</header>
  <section className="text-center">...</section>
  <main className="flex flex-1 gap-8 px-[90px]">
    <RewardsList />
    <WinnerPanel />
  </main>
  <footer className="bg-[#7a0513] flex items-center justify-between px-[90px] py-4">...</footer>
</div>

// ❌ BAD — flat single div, no division structure
<div><img /><h1 /><ul /><button /></div>
```
